title: "Tactical Topology: Football as a Communication Network"
abstract: >-
  Analysis of football team tactical structure using communication-network
  theory (graph resilience, max-flow/min-cut, latency/tempo, pressing as
  interference) on StatsBomb open data, with interpretable ML models and
  publication-quality visualisations.
